  "description": "The X-LITE FOUR DISC Ultegra Di2 – a thoroughbred racehorse, pawing restlessly at the ground! With our ROSE R Thirty Disc Light wheels and Continental GP 5000 700x25c tyres, it tackles climbs boldly. On fast descents, excellent stiffness values keep the bike safely on track. The agile character of the racing bike is created by its streamlined frame with amazing aerodynamic values and special carbon layering with best stiffness values for crankset and steering head – for perfect handling and ultimate speed for every rider. Another advantage: The frame already comes with a mounting point to attach a Dura-Ace power meter. Featuring a powerful disc brake, this model offers excellent braking performance in wet conditions and at high speeds, too. Even at full speed, it will bring you to a halt safely. The design of the X-LITE FOUR DISC Ultegra Di2 is smart and clean. This model works with the electronic Ultegra Di2, which has been approved by pros and allows for easy, lightning-fast gear changes. One bike, no compromises: the new X-LITE FOUR DISC! * approx. 7.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for UD carbon/emergency orange frame, size 57 cm, compact, without pedals",
